        "name": "evaluate_single_unit_matchup",
        "description": "Conditional two-unit combat projection, not a battle winner prediction. For material supported passives, supply side.passives with sourced key and explicit initial_active, and compare an otherwise identical disabled run. Inspect effect_phases and passive_coverage; omitted effects are base-stats-only. Engine equality/reactivation is not inferred. Resolve ambiguous names first; inspect assumptions, sensitivity and limitations. Missing/nonpositive source velocity uses a labeled immediate-arrival approximation. If its damage is material, rerun with flight_seconds equal to that side's returned cycle_seconds as an illustrative delayed case; report both outcomes. bounds_cross does not cover flight timing. Build labeled projectiles_per_cycle cases from nontrivial source projectile, volley and burst counts; compare multiple factors individually rather than multiplying them or claiming exact engine cadence.",
